Sītā sees five monkeys on hilltop --- Sītā drops silk cloth and ornaments among them --- Monkeys watch wailing Sītā with unwinking eyes --- Rāvaṇa crosses ocean with wailing Sītā --- Cāraṇas cry this is Rāvaṇa end --- Rāvaṇa lodges Sītā in inner apartments --- Rāvaṇa orders Rākṣasīs to guard and serve Sītā --- Rāvaṇa sends eight Rākṣasas to watch and kill Rāma